WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:04.800
Your son believes we could modestly curtail Eldest Brother's princely stipends as a token disciplinary reprimand.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Simultaneously, we should pacify the displaced refugees and accelerate construction on the canal.

00:10.480 --> 00:15.000
No matter how arduous the labor, we will see Father's waterway brought to completion without delay!

00:15.000 --> 00:19.000
Good... splendid! Very well said.
